{"repo": {"name": {"en-US": "train-libre F-Droid Repo"}, "description": {"en-US": "Automated F-Droid repository for train-libre"}, "icon": {"en-US": {"name": "/icons/icon.png", "sha256": "e0809c6a3aaa0bf8d544c1941196b5065fa044a62d3b2d12d47b4d773d72fb5e", "size": 818}}, "address": "https://rfivesix.github.io/train-libre/fdroid/repo", "timestamp": 1781435949000, "categories": {"Sports & Health": {"name": {"en-US": "Sports & Health"}}}}, "packages": {"com.rfivesix.trainlibre": {"metadata": {"added": 1781435942000, "categories": ["Sports & Health"], "issueTracker": "https://github.com/rfivesix/train-libre/issues", "lastUpdated": 1781435944000, "license": "GPL-3.0-or-later", "sourceCode": "https://github.com/rfivesix/train-libre", "webSite": "https://github.com/rfivesix/train-libre", "screenshots": {"phone": {"de-DE": [{"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/de-DE/phoneScreenshots/01.png", "sha256": "d6ed7b6b3f87e6b90159b5ccce28a5c8a9dbe36158bc0f5a637ca797314911ee", "size": 313980}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/de-DE/phoneScreenshots/02.png", "sha256": "c22663b1d735be7f2142443d4c21adec938022380a4328f94ad53eacd0c5e6df", "size": 281827}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/de-DE/phoneScreenshots/03.png", "sha256": "483e3b054143137ea0a1b8af61151230ff13e821df548b774b52a2d0a710384d", "size": 261315}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/de-DE/phoneScreenshots/04.png", "sha256": "566dcd86cac881feecc9a4d564dce2eb9dd3cb02b1c8b89b2dd252eb64ddd83c", "size": 330033}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/de-DE/phoneScreenshots/05.png", "sha256": "8efcd32c871a6100c9cca3bc72f2219db2167cfe13a0f581dc6cfd5e3cd0ff42", "size": 352249}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/de-DE/phoneScreenshots/06.png", "sha256": "342d8274a8229fd4cccfa1698baf74e05f1114268e02a1517af2dffa509f2bc3", "size": 481924}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/de-DE/phoneScreenshots/07.png", "sha256": "0eaf20746ed55e808fd1a7a4d15057fc1d1969f50260251b6ade5f30c4d3d893", "size": 403101}], "en-US": [{"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/en-US/phoneScreenshots/01.png", "sha256": "d6ed7b6b3f87e6b90159b5ccce28a5c8a9dbe36158bc0f5a637ca797314911ee", "size": 313980}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/en-US/phoneScreenshots/02.png", "sha256": "c22663b1d735be7f2142443d4c21adec938022380a4328f94ad53eacd0c5e6df", "size": 281827}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/en-US/phoneScreenshots/03.png", "sha256": "483e3b054143137ea0a1b8af61151230ff13e821df548b774b52a2d0a710384d", "size": 261315}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/en-US/phoneScreenshots/04.png", "sha256": "566dcd86cac881feecc9a4d564dce2eb9dd3cb02b1c8b89b2dd252eb64ddd83c", "size": 330033}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/en-US/phoneScreenshots/05.png", "sha256": "8efcd32c871a6100c9cca3bc72f2219db2167cfe13a0f581dc6cfd5e3cd0ff42", "size": 352249}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/en-US/phoneScreenshots/06.png", "sha256": "342d8274a8229fd4cccfa1698baf74e05f1114268e02a1517af2dffa509f2bc3", "size": 481924}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/en-US/phoneScreenshots/07.png", "sha256": "0eaf20746ed55e808fd1a7a4d15057fc1d1969f50260251b6ade5f30c4d3d893", "size": 403101}]}}, "name": {"en-US": "Train Libre", "de-DE": "Train Libre"}, "summary": {"en-US": "Open-source workout and nutrition tracker with local-first data.", "de-DE": "Open-Source Tracker für Training und Ernährung mit lokalen Daten."}, "description": {"en-US": "Train Libre is an open-source, offline-first fitness tracker for people who want serious training and nutrition logging without giving up control of their data.\n\nFeatures:\n- Log workouts set by set, including warm-ups, working sets, failure sets, dropsets, reps, weight, and RIR\n- Build reusable routines and review completed sessions\n- Track nutrition, meals, hydration, caffeine, creatine, supplements, bodyweight, and body measurements\n- Use progress statistics for PRs, consistency, muscle volume, recovery, body trends, calories, sleep, steps, and pulse where available\n- Keep app data local by default, with export and import for local backups\n- Use integrated Open Food Facts and wger-based catalog sources\n- Export supported app-recorded data one way to Google Health Connect\n- Use optional AI meal features with your own API key, disabled by default\n\nWhat makes Train Libre different:\n- Open source and developed in public\n- Offline-first, with no mandatory cloud account\n- Built for structured gym tracking instead of gamification\n- Transparent analytics designed to be understandable and useful over the long term\n\nTrain Libre is not a medical app. Recovery, sleep, and pulse features are intended for training guidance and personal tracking only and are not medical diagnosis or treatment.\n\nOpen Source:\nThe source code is publicly available and the app is developed in the open.\n", "de-DE": "Train Libre ist ein Open-Source Fitness-Tracker für Menschen, die Training und Ernährung ernsthaft protokollieren wollen, ohne die Kontrolle über ihre Daten abzugeben.\n\nFunktionen:\n- Workouts Satz für Satz protokollieren, inklusive Aufwärmsätzen, Arbeitssätzen, Sätzen bis zum Versagen, Dropsets, Wiederholungen, Gewicht und RIR\n- Routinen erstellen, wiederverwenden und abgeschlossene Einheiten auswerten\n- Ernährung, Mahlzeiten, Hydration, Koffein, Kreatin, Supplements, Körpergewicht und Körpermaße tracken\n- Statistiken für PRs, Konsistenz, Muskelvolumen, Recovery, Körpertrends, Kalorien, Schlaf, Schritte und Puls nutzen, sofern Daten verfügbar sind\n- App-Daten standardmäßig lokal behalten, inklusive Export und Import lokaler Backups\n- Integrierte Datenquellen auf Basis von Open Food Facts und wger verwenden\n- Unterstützte selbst erfasste Daten einseitig zu Google Health Connect exportieren\n- Optionale KI-Mahlzeitenfunktionen mit eigenem API-Key nutzen, standardmäßig deaktiviert\n\nWas Train Libre besonders macht:\n- Open Source und öffentlich entwickelt\n- Offline-first, ohne verpflichtenden Cloud-Account\n- Gebaut für strukturiertes Krafttraining statt Gamification\n- Transparente Analysen, die langfristig verständlich und nützlich bleiben sollen\n\nTrain Libre ist keine medizinische App. Recovery-, Schlaf- und Pulsfunktionen dienen der Trainingsplanung und persönlichen Orientierung und stellen keine medizinische Diagnose oder Behandlung dar.\n\nOpen Source:\nDer Quellcode ist öffentlich verfügbar und die App wird offen entwickelt.\n"}, "icon": {"en-US": {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/en-US/icon_BDpnPPO5DCAteR-f5uh6yr8SZKF_miQjdDozt7si38I=.png", "sha256": "043a673cf3b90c202d791f9fe6e87acabf1264a17f9a2423743a33b7bb22dfc2", "size": 13030}, "de-DE": {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/de-DE/icon_BDpnPPO5DCAteR-f5uh6yr8SZKF_miQjdDozt7si38I=.png", "sha256": "043a673cf3b90c202d791f9fe6e87acabf1264a17f9a2423743a33b7bb22dfc2", "size": 13030}}, "preferredSigner": "7bea1cc437d23ad86535001c2996c22def49d8d75bd6b4942b6aad59572b17cc"}, "versions": {"c6e1faff9c18a65034194ea5fbe009c2b4cd9169c344b5dd710291bce76b2738": {"added": 1781435944000, "file": {"name": "/app-x86_64-release.apk", "sha256": "c6e1faff9c18a65034194ea5fbe009c2b4cd9169c344b5dd710291bce76b2738", "size": 35871508}, "manifest": {"nativecode": ["x86_64"], "versionName": "0.9.29", "versionCode": 94047, "usesSdk": {"minSdkVersion": 26, "targetSdkVersion": 36}, "signer": {"sha256": ["7bea1cc437d23ad86535001c2996c22def49d8d75bd6b4942b6aad59572b17cc"]}, "usesPermission": [{"name": "android.permission.INTERNET"}, {"name": "android.permission.READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE", "maxSdkVersion": 32}, {"name": "android.permission.WRITE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE", "maxSdkVersion": 28}, {"name": "android.permission.CAMERA"}, {"name": "android.permission.POST_NOTIFICATIONS"}, {"name": "android.permission.health.READ_STEPS"}, {"name": "android.permission.health.READ_SLEEP"}, {"name": "android.permission.health.READ_HEART_RATE"}, {"name": "android.permission.health.WRITE_WEIGHT"}, {"name": "android.permission.health.WRITE_BODY_FAT"}, {"name": "android.permission.health.WRITE_NUTRITION"}, {"name": "android.permission.health.WRITE_